Rejuvenation Cast
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to RESTORATION_Rejuvenation 
    Actions
        -------- == ABILITY MODIFIER == --------
        Set VariableSet Ability_TempLevel = (Level of (Ability being cast) for (Triggering unit))
        Set VariableSet Ability_TempAmount = (Ability_Rejuvenation_Base[Ability_TempLevel] + (1.25 x (Real((Intelligence of (Triggering unit) (Include bonuses))))))
        -------- If unit has Totemic Resurgence --------
        Trigger - Run Totemic Resurgence <gen> (checking conditions)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet Ability_TempAmount = (Ability_TempAmount x TotemicResurgence_Real)
            Else - Actions
        -------- ==   == --------
        Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: (Triggering unit)'s Ability with Ability Code: RESTORATION_Rejuvenation )'s Real Level Field: Hit Points Gained ('Rej1') of Level: ((Level of RESTORATION_Rejuvenation  for (Triggering unit)) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
        Unit - Increase level of RESTORATION_Rejuvenation  for (Triggering unit)
        Unit - Decrease level of RESTORATION_Rejuvenation  for (Triggering unit)
